  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Marsabit HCD project 2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A CAFOD will support Diocese of Marsabit through provision of grant to develop a new strategic Plan and establish a consolidated HR manual.  Diocese of Marsabitwill develop these documents through consulting with staff, organisational management and ensuring activate participation of all stakeholders.  It is expected that this process will improve relationships with a wide variety of stakeholders, build teamwork, bring coherence to different projects and parts of the organisation, ensuring they are pulling together.</narrative>
  </description>
